      },
      "text": "Other cuts:\n  Princess (square brilliant), Emerald (step cut), Oval, Pear, Marquise,\n  Heart, Cushion, Radiant, Asscher (square step), Trillion\nStep cuts (emerald, Asscher): parallel facets → less brilliance,\n  more \"hall of mirrors\" effect; show clarity more prominently\n```"
