        "section": "mineralogy",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Gemology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nGIA COLOR SCALE (colorless to yellow/brown, for diamonds):\n  D, E, F  ← Colorless (rare, premium)\n  G, H, I, J ← Near colorless\n  K, L, M ← Faint yellow\n  N–R ← Very light yellow\n  S–Z ← Light yellow/brown"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-GEMOLOGY.md#012",
      "path": [
        "07-GEMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:mineralogy:07-gemology, git-history:mineralogy:07-gemology]",
        "canonical_path": "mineralogy/07-GEMOLOGY.md",
