        "root_concepts": "[gemology]",
        "section": "mineralogy",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Gemology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Why color at all?\n  Nitrogen (N) impurities: most common; yellow/brown hues\n  Boron (B): blue (rare; Hope Diamond is Type IIb)\n  Plastic deformation: pink/purple/red (rarest colors; Argyle mine)\n  Irradiation: green (natural + lab-induced)"
    },
