        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Gemology",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "FANCY COLOR DIAMONDS: Different scale — more color = more value\n  Fancy Blue (Hope Diamond): nitrogen-free; B impurity\n  Fancy Red: rarest diamond color; plastic deformation related\n  Fancy Pink: Argyle mine (Australia; closed 2020) was primary source\n  Fancy Yellow (Canary): high N content; some quite saturated\n  Fancy Black: graphite inclusions or surface irradiation\n```"
    }
